      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——她叫爱如往昔。\n是从今日起与我一起以闪耀系列赛为目标的、\n我的担当赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8764e9ca84ebaa3b1768b6f17b92f61053db1749b37d46187c7a7d08abf70c57",
