      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "便会现出世间罕见的异形之姿。\n……但、那令观者恐惧的奔跑——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e490e3d0a2286b52be7348d86b8c866bcd4763ef6335109ae22625e6d24d8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
