    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceb8082039c778698e51ba92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论过去多久……都鲜明地烙印在脑海里、挥之不去。\n她那奔跑的姿态……那股气势……\n那份恐惧……深深铭刻在内心深处——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9a80915dbcfdc72692689bb078c1e288fa9229190ad2d0072848c9acdbacae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
