    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4526c6a99ee538e8b0dbec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……――",
      "source_fingerprint": "23186b327972af5a3f1459c7e50bff477a7adcfd028bd8bfc87588defc6f282f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945a093e065693f41a7578ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "内敛理性的一面、与本能驱动的一面。\n身负难以驾驭的双重面貌、\n想必她承受了远超想象的艰辛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6294798345dec7cec40e8c93660b75a3d8fe0f5445e332fe4da4b16d4f77c958",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc0061b21cf395f907e142c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（无论是怎样的她——我都要全力支持）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9ba881f1e0775033a04386286d502768a5cc0b3c10e9b3488055eadfa74e48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:501c37175ed046efd5efb96b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然我作为训练员与她缔结了契约、\n便对她的未来肩负着重大的责任。\n换言之、我该做的事情只有一件——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e061698270bc57fbeef19d77733a546d200c474fd926dc4c1f22d8dab83f3e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae3ff83f432798036a215eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯、明天见",
      "source_fingerprint": "a124752f354c721cfde097fdc3f03c9f855d6c516ea76e44b539c70764268df8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
