    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feec5121acd44499d1a6ca4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——那么、今天便到这里了……。\n您辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c599632da35faf814888cb8636e024f3af9bf63ab1a7de598f0ef77e0c3ede9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0578922842e76b7f46a0b6aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首次的搭档训练平安结束、\n她并未显现出本能觉醒的迹象。\n看来只要避开\"特定条件\"基本不会有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "551540ba7fb3f29067add918ca9f16ef6211cab0ee0db5ee31630a3017c9e654",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d07852042207bee5264bb10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（话虽如此、无法控制这点仍未改变）",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b1438ce4777669dd9a4b3588f2e7fba8fd5dfeec5adeeab6c11181f1f3466b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
