    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01cec7d5f77519812abe37e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能让她本能觉醒的条件……\n目前已知的是“与强者竞技”\n以及“满月之夜”——这两个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72f4af198789eaed807101b72702f6ac8ed1c86da2b4bb20fe4c5ef839cc7a39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb8fe889972d9ab127a1525",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（好、再加会班想想吧）",
      "source_fingerprint": "680fa88c0e22f8730d62b7785262827e0127ebc69040296c45511300f1ca240a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b915e7a5c15686a5bcf91c31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔的状态尚不稳定。\n今后可能需要制定特殊训练方案、\n以应对各种潜在情况吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9c31c8b72a37cf5b95fd320f199a8e36b23d7dd7ba01f4141cc8751da411c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1097/storytimeline_501097100.json",
      "json_path": [
